  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DM support to communities in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to success of the previous DM community-led support, this intervention aims to reinitiate conducting Enhanced&#xA0;Vulnerability and Capacity Assessments (EVCA) in two governorates in Yemen (Ibb and Hadramout). Using the&#xA0;recommendations from the&#xA0;EVCA&#x2019;s&#xA0;as a basis,&#xA0;the project for 2023&#xA0;will focus on&#xA0;building&#xA0;disaster risk reduction through&#xA0;community-based&#xA0;preparedness (including supporting the NS to efficiently and effectively deliver these services).&#xA0;This area of focus aims to ensure the recommendations&#xA0;specifically identified&#xA0;by the communities&#xA0;are met&#xA0;to&#xA0;help reduce their vulnerability&#xA0;and meet their immediate needs.&#xA0;
The overall goal is to&#xA0;reduce&#xA0;the&#xA0;vulnerability of communities in Yemen to the effects of&#xA0;the ongoing humanitarian crisis, exacerbated by recurrent&#xA0;natural&#xA0;and&#xA0;man-made&#xA0;hazards.</narrative>
  </description>
